  "statement": "Find\n\n\\[\\frac{2^{2}}{2^{2}-1} \\cdot \\frac{3^{2}}{3^{2}-1} \\cdot \\frac{4^{2}}{4^{2}-1} \\cdots \\cdots \\frac{2006^{2}}{2006^{2}-1}\\]",
